(version 1)

# No custom rules: clearances follow the Tinker-Mantis and live in Board Setup -- 0.1 mm net-class clearance
# everywhere (the 0.35 mm-pitch P4 and the 0.4 mm-pitch LNA need nothing tighter), 0.09 mm minimum track, 0.1 mm
# hole clearance, 0.2 mm hole-to-hole and copper-to-edge. The GND pour sets its own 0.2 mm clearance: that is the
# RF line's ground gap, so it must not follow the net classes down.
